                                   "snippet":  "[Letterboxd Review of \"Like Father Like Son\"] Would watch an entire movie of Dudley Moore playing a teenager. Regrettably, that is only half of this movie, which also consists of scenes where Kirk Cameron acts like an adult. Those are not as good.",
