                                   "title":  "Letterboxd review of Like Father Like Son",
                                   "snippet":  "[Letterboxd Review of \"Like Father Like Son\"] I remember my mum took me to see this at the cinema for my birthday. There must have been fuck all else on that day to make me pick this!!!!I remember not really caring for it then and it’s the same now! If you compare it to Big then good god it’s even worse! Dudley Moore is awful at playing a teenager unlike Tom Hanks! What a shit birthday! 😂😂",
                                   "link":  "https://letterboxd.com/film/like-father-like-son/"
