                               {
                                   "title":  "Letterboxd review of Like Father Like Son",
                                   "snippet":  "[Letterboxd Review of \"Like Father Like Son\"] Honestly I’ve always really liked this. I’m a big Dudley Moore fan and I really miss 80’s Kirk Cameron. Not every joke works but this is a fun body swap comedy that manages to have some heart too. Always fun to see Sean Aston too.",
