                                   "title":  "Like Father Like Son movie review - Roger Ebert",
                                   "snippet":  "\"Like Father Like Son\" has a far darker heart, which is shockingly on display within the first three minutes. And if, for some reason, you miss the beginning of the movie, don\u0027t worry. Jay will return to the violent act that sets the story in motion over and over again throughout his numbingly repetitive editing structure.",
